{"root":{"data":{"id":"8af281ad7683","created":1618970679,"text":"java主流锁"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cat18294d8o0","created":1618970722179,"text":"线程要不要锁住同步资源？"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cat18o7cgyo0","created":1618970769961,"text":"锁住"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cat18rgpn600","created":1618970777058,"text":"不锁住"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cat19cry20w0","created":1618970823449,"text":"锁住同步资源失败，线程要不要阻塞"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cat1a2c4rgw0","created":1618970879089,"text":"阻塞"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cat1a50pdpk0","created":1618970884929,"text":"不阻塞"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cat1ah8hwcg0","created":1618970911521,"text":"自旋锁"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cat1alyrr0w0","created":1618970921817,"text":"适应性自旋锁"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"cat1ay5d6q00","created":1618970948337,"text":"多线程竞争同步资源的流程和细节有没有区别？"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cat1byoq9mo0","created":1618971027872,"text":"不锁住资源，多线程中只能有一个能修改资源成功，其它线程会重试"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cat1crah5yg0","created":1618971090137,"text":"无锁"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cat1cwtpxyw0","created":1618971102185,"text":"同一个线程执行同步资源时自动获取资源"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cat1dciedeo0","created":1618971136329,"text":"偏向锁"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cat1dkptrpk0","created":1618971154192,"text":"多线程竞争同步资源时，没有获取资源的线程自旋等锁待释放"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cat1ei1fee00","created":1618971226727,"text":"轻量级锁"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cat1esztvfs0","created":1618971250575,"text":"多线程竞争同步资源时，没有获取资源的线程阻塞等待唤醒"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cat1femz7eg0","created":1618971297687,"text":"重量级锁"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"cat1fjnp7hc0","created":1618971308615,"text":"多个线程竞争锁时要不要排队？"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cat1fu4dsqg0","created":1618971331392,"text":"排队"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cat1fzp8dsg0","created":1618971343536,"text":"公平锁"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cat1g3919tc0","created":1618971351264,"text":"先尝试插队，插队失败再排队"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cat1gffwfyg0","created":1618971377800,"text":"非公平锁"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"cat1gm4fjvk0","created":1618971392344,"text":"一个线程中的多个流程能不能获取同一把锁"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cat1h0u0r8o0","created":1618971424367,"text":"能"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cat1h5fsxog0","created":1618971434391,"text":"可重入锁"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cat1h36698o0","created":1618971429455,"text":"不能"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cat1hctc0og0","created":1618971450447,"text":"非可重入锁"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"cat1hkov5u00","created":1618971467591,"text":"多线程能不能共享一把锁"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cat1hssc2yo0","created":1618971485215,"text":"能"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cat1hwvuuiw0","created":1618971494135,"text":"共享锁"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cat1huwy1sw0","created":1618971489847,"text":"不能"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cat1hzvtri80","created":1618971500663,"text":"排他锁"},"children":[]}]}]}]},"template":"right","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}